    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "What did the network learn? The classifier has a narrow layer of 8 units right before its head. Take those 8 numbers for each of the 450 test images and project them to 2D with PCA; next to it is the same projection of the raw 64 pixels. The digits pull apart into clusters in the trained layer and pile on top of each other in the raw pixels. The script scores it as the share of points whose nearest neighbour in 2D is the same digit: 0.538 for raw pixels, 0.658 for the trained layer (test accuracy 0.956).\n\n網路學到了什麼？這個分類器在分類頭前面有一層只有 8 個單元的窄層。對 450 張測試影像各取出這 8 個數字，用 PCA 投影到 2D；旁邊是原始 64 個像素的同一種投影。訓練過的那一層裡，數字分成一群一群；原始像素裡則疊在一起。腳本用「2D 中最近的點是同一個數字的比例」來量化：原始像素 0.538，訓練過的層 0.658（測試正確率 0.956）。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-hidden",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 2520,
        "y": -180
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The script runs every layer except the last Linear. For a model of your own, cut where the features you want to look at come out; EmbeddingScatter takes any [N, D] tensor. Its t-SNE setting separates even the raw pixels here, so use PCA when the question is what training changed.\n\n腳本執行除了最後一個 Linear 以外的所有層。換成你自己的模型時，從想看的特徵輸出的地方切開即可；EmbeddingScatter 接受任何 [N, D] 張量。它的 t-SNE 設定在這裡連原始像素都能分開，所以想看「訓練改變了什麼」時用 PCA。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "hidden-trained",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -440
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
      }
    }
